          ],
          "details": "1. Create a Dockerfile using Python Alpine as base image\n2. Install necessary dependencies for ICMP operations\n3. Configure container with CAP_NET_RAW capability for raw socket access\n4. Implement proper user permissions (non-root user when possible)\n5. Add health check endpoint to verify plugin status\n6. Optimize container size by removing unnecessary packages\n7. Include proper logging configuration\n8. Document required Docker run parameters\n9. Testing approach: Build container and verify it can perform ICMP operations with correct permissions, validate security using container scanning tools",
          "status": "done",
          "parentTaskId": 32
        },
