          "details": "1. Implement MQTT client to subscribe to 'penpal/discoveries/networks' topic\n2. Create message parser to extract network information from MQTT messages\n3. Develop integration with ScanQueue service to queue ping sweep jobs\n4. Implement JobsTracker service integration to update scan status\n5. Add retry mechanism for failed service connections\n6. Create configuration for MQTT broker connection details\n7. Implement proper error handling for messaging failures\n8. Add logging for all service interactions\n9. Testing approach: Create mock MQTT broker and service endpoints to test integration, verify message handling and job tracking",
